@startuml Sequence_CreateJoinRoom
!theme plain
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Sequence Diagram - Create Room & Join Room

actor "Chủ phòng\n(Host)" as Host
actor "Người chơi\n(Player)" as Player
participant "Frontend\n(UI)" as UI
participant "RoomController" as RoomCtrl
participant "RoomService" as RoomSvc
participant "RoomRepository" as RoomRepo
database "Database" as DB

' ============ CREATE ROOM ============
== Tạo phòng (Create Room) ==

Host -> UI : Nhấn "Tạo phòng"
activate UI

UI -> UI : Hiển thị form cài đặt phòng
Host -> UI : Nhập cài đặt\n(thời gian, luật chơi)
UI -> RoomCtrl : POST /api/rooms/create\n{hostId, settings}
activate RoomCtrl

RoomCtrl -> RoomSvc : createRoom(hostId, settings)
activate RoomSvc

RoomSvc -> RoomSvc : generateUniqueCode()
note right: Tạo mã phòng 6 ký tự\nví dụ: "ABC123"

RoomSvc -> RoomRepo : save(room)
activate RoomRepo
RoomRepo -> DB : INSERT room
DB --> RoomRepo : roomId
RoomRepo --> RoomSvc : Room
deactivate RoomRepo

RoomSvc --> RoomCtrl : Room{code, status=OPEN}
deactivate RoomSvc

RoomCtrl --> UI : 201 Created\n{roomCode, inviteLink}
deactivate RoomCtrl

UI --> Host : Hiển thị mã phòng & link mời
deactivate UI

Host -> Host : Chia sẻ mã/link cho bạn bè

|||

' ============ JOIN ROOM ============
== Tham gia phòng (Join Room) ==

Player -> UI : Nhập mã phòng / Click link
activate UI

UI -> RoomCtrl : POST /api/rooms/join\n{roomCode, playerId}
activate RoomCtrl

RoomCtrl -> RoomSvc : joinRoom(roomCode, playerId)
activate RoomSvc

RoomSvc -> RoomRepo : findByCode(roomCode)
activate RoomRepo
RoomRepo -> DB : SELECT * FROM rooms WHERE code = ?
DB --> RoomRepo : Room / null
RoomRepo --> RoomSvc : Room / null
deactivate RoomRepo

alt Mã phòng không tồn tại
    RoomSvc --> RoomCtrl : RoomNotFoundException
    RoomCtrl --> UI : 404 Not Found\n{error: "Mã phòng không hợp lệ"}
    UI --> Player : Thông báo lỗi
    
else Phòng đã đầy (2 người)
    RoomSvc --> RoomCtrl : RoomFullException
    RoomCtrl --> UI : 400 Bad Request\n{error: "Phòng đã đầy"}
    UI --> Player : Thông báo lỗi
    
else Phòng đang trong trận đấu
    RoomSvc --> RoomCtrl : RoomInMatchException
    RoomCtrl --> UI : 400 Bad Request\n{error: "Phòng đang trong trận đấu"}
    UI --> Player : Thông báo lỗi
    
else Tham gia thành công
    RoomSvc -> RoomSvc : addPlayer(playerId)
    RoomSvc -> RoomRepo : update(room)
    activate RoomRepo
    RoomRepo -> DB : UPDATE rooms SET status = 'READY'
    RoomRepo --> RoomSvc : Room
    deactivate RoomRepo
    
    RoomSvc --> RoomCtrl : Room{status=READY}
    deactivate RoomSvc
    
    RoomCtrl --> UI : 200 OK\n{room, players}
    deactivate RoomCtrl
    
    UI --> Player : Vào phòng chờ
    UI --> Host : Thông báo có người tham gia
    
    note over Host, Player
        Cả hai người chơi đều thấy
        nhau trong phòng chờ
    end note
end

deactivate UI

|||

' ============ START MATCH ============
== Bắt đầu trận đấu (Start Match) ==

Host -> UI : Nhấn "Bắt đầu trận đấu"
activate UI

UI -> RoomCtrl : POST /api/rooms/{roomCode}/start
activate RoomCtrl

RoomCtrl -> RoomSvc : startMatch(roomCode)
activate RoomSvc

RoomSvc -> RoomSvc : validateRoomReady()
RoomSvc -> RoomSvc : initializeChessGame()
RoomSvc -> RoomRepo : update(room)
activate RoomRepo
RoomRepo -> DB : UPDATE status = 'IN_MATCH'
RoomRepo --> RoomSvc : Room
deactivate RoomRepo

RoomSvc --> RoomCtrl : GameSession{boardState, timeControl}
deactivate RoomSvc

RoomCtrl --> UI : 200 OK\n{gameSession}
deactivate RoomCtrl

UI --> Host : Hiển thị bàn cờ
UI --> Player : Hiển thị bàn cờ

note over Host, Player
    Trận đấu bắt đầu
    WebSocket được sử dụng để
    đồng bộ nước đi real-time
end note

deactivate UI

@enduml
